  "subtitle_en": "",
  "lead": "土的重量向她靠近。她接住，也選擇把它引往能夠承接的地方。",
  "lead_en": "The weight of earth draws near. She receives it, then chooses a direction where it can be held.",
  "statement": "土的重量向她靠近。她接住，也選擇把它引往能夠承接的地方。\n\n力量不是永遠扛著。當工作重新開始，她也伸出手，讓別人替她鬆開護片。\n\nDurga 的主動力量，是這段創作的起點。她決定何時承擔、如何轉向，也決定何時接受照料。",
  "statement_en": "The weight of earth draws near. She receives it, then chooses a direction where it can be held.\n\nStrength need not mean carrying forever. As work begins again, she extends her hand and lets others loosen her armour.\n\nDurga’s active strength is the starting point of this work. She decides when to bear weight, how to redirect it, and when to accept care.",
  "afterword": "",
  "afterword_en": "",
  "series_statement": "《神話未完成》\n史旺姬走進流傳至今的神話，留下它最核心的問題，讓它面對今天的生活。神話一直被講述、被使用，所以還沒有完成。",
  "series_statement_en": "Myths in the Making\nSwanky Ji steps into myths that are still being told, keeps the question at their heart, and lets it meet the life we live now. A myth that is still told and still used is not yet finished.",
